{"2526030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pakapow Party", "steam_appid": 2526030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526030/extras/73d36888e9db1104880908c5df91366e.avif?t=1783997543\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526030/extras_big/73d36888e9db1104880908c5df91366e.avif?t=1783997543 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-4 Players | Spin the Wheel &amp; Battle Bosses | Team Up or Sabotage Friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pakapow Party is an online board game for 1–4 players, where you’ll go on an adventure to protect villages from invading monsters, seize resources, and explore strange, unpredictable stories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could end up becoming an ultrarich tycoon but beware, your teammates might just turn you into a poor wanderer! Are you ready to team up with friends and take on fearsome bosses in Pakapow Party?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526030/extras/0592a21eaaf8b1f917bb9190748fa9f7.avif?t=1783997543\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the spinner and set off on your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter monsters and fantastical story events that await you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down the evil bosses out to challenge brave heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy vibrant, charming visuals paired with elegant, dynamic action!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"